## Why This Is Asked

This question probes design thinking for performance testing in CPU/GPU mixed workloads, with burst traffic and cross-tenant contention, exploring throughput, latency, autoscaling, backpressure, and observability.

## Key Concepts

- Burst/load modeling for mixed CPU/GPU workloads
- Contention and tail latency measurement
- Autoscaling strategies (HPA, KEDA) and backpressure
- Circuit breakers and SLA validation

## Code Example

